  "input_elements": [
    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "Initially, it is important to check the Referee Reports."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "At the same time, you should continue to monitor if the Referee Reports have been completed."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "If they have been completed,"
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "if they have not been completed,"
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "you should flag it and send a reminder."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "After that, you should check again if the Referee Reports have been completed."
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "If they have,"
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "If not,"
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "you should flag it again and send another reminder."
    },
    {
      "id": "i10",
      "content": "you can move on to organizing interviews for the Selection Panel with the top candidates."
    },
    {
      "id": "i11",
      "content": "After the interviews, it is necessary to receive feedback from the interview candidates."
    },
    {
      "id": "i12",
      "content": "Next, you need to check if a Psychometric Test is required."
    },
    {
      "id": "i13",
      "content": "If it is,"
    },
    {
      "id": "i14",
      "content": "you should then check if an HR Specialist is required."
    },
    {
      "id": "i15",
      "content": "you can continue with the process and coordinate the second round of selection."
    },
    {
      "id": "i16",
      "content": "If an HR Specialist is required,"
    },
    {
      "id": "i17",
      "content": "you should schedule the test with a third party."
    },
    {
      "id": "i18",
      "content": "Otherwise,"
    },
    {
      "id": "i19",
      "content": "you can proceed to complete the Psychometric Test."
    },
    {
      "id": "i20",
      "content": "Finally, you should request the final candidate ranking and continue with the process."
    }
  ]
